WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.554
Hi! A vocabulary cloze tests meaning, not grammar. You choose the word that fits best. Today we'll learn how.

2
00:00:10.704 --> 00:00:15.666
First read it all to know the topic: a beach trip? Baking a cake?

3
00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:21.042
Look at the words around the ___ and the next sentence; they often give hints.

4
00:00:21.192 --> 00:00:24.834
Try all four options, not just the first one.

5
00:00:24.984 --> 00:00:29.658
Some words may work, but choose the best fit.

6
00:00:29.808 --> 00:00:34.506
The topic helps: a beach story has sand, waves and shells.

7
00:00:34.656 --> 00:00:37.818
What a character does tells you how they feel.

8
00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:42.546
Remember collocations: brush your teeth, catch a bus.

9
00:00:42.696 --> 00:00:47.202
The next sentence often explains the ___.

10
00:00:47.352 --> 00:00:52.026
Watch out! Correct grammar doesn't mean the meaning is right!

11
00:00:52.176 --> 00:00:56.418
When hungry you eat food, so ate goes with a plate of rice.

12
00:00:56.568 --> 00:01:02.058
After choosing, ask yourself: would this happen in real life?

13
00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:12.066
Your turn! At the beach, we built a castle with, ___. Which one? Pause and think.

14
00:01:12.216 --> 00:01:17.994
A castle at the beach is made of sand. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:28.146
Another one! Mum used a, ___, to cut the cake. Which one? Pause and think.

16
00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:33.354
You cut a cake with a knife. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:33.504 --> 00:01:43.362
Here's another! The crowd, ___, when our team scored. Which one? Pause and think.

18
00:01:43.512 --> 00:01:49.026
When the team scores, people cheer. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:49.176 --> 00:01:58.818
Try one more! Hurry up or we will miss the, ___! Which one? Pause and think.

20
00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:04.314
Hurry, or we'll miss the bus. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:04.464 --> 00:02:14.994
Try one more! The flowers, ___, because nobody watered them. Which one? Pause and think.

22
00:02:15.144 --> 00:02:20.922
With no water, the flowers wilted. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:21.072 --> 00:02:30.786
Try one more! I use an, ___, when it rains. Which one? Pause and think.

24
00:02:30.936 --> 00:02:36.498
When it rains, we use an umbrella. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:36.648 --> 00:02:46.362
Last one! The ice cream, ___, in the hot sun. Which one? Pause and think.

26
00:02:46.512 --> 00:02:52.770
The hot sun makes ice cream melt, so melted. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:52.920 --> 00:03:03.666
Remember: a vocabulary cloze tests meaning. Read it all for the topic, find clues around the ___ and in the next sentence, try every option, and pick the best fit.

28
00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:08.850
When reading a story, cover a word and try to guess it!

